s in 2019.\"}]}],\n \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were quantified and stratified by age group and sex, using four metrics\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Overall visit ratios were calculated comparing ED visit rates during these periods in 2020-2022 with rates for the corresponding epidemiologic weeks in 2019.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Rates were calculated by dividing the number of cannabis-related ED visits by the total number of ED visits\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Visit ratios were calculated by dividing the rate of cannabis-related ED visits during the surveillance period\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Visit ratios by sex were calculated by dividing the rate of female cannabis-related ED visits during the surveillance period\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"95% CIs that exclude 1 are statistically significant.\"}],\n \"confidence\": \"medium\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}\n```", "type": "text"}]}